Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.16,0:03:05.16,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp15\bord2.5\fs55\1a&HFF&\pos(960,380)\3c&H0D084A&}「第三個奴隸、被拒絕{\fsp0}」
